### 📄 PURCHASE - Iniciar Compra
### POST /api/v1/purchase/initiate
### Inicia una transacción de compra y retorna instrucciones de transacción
### Documentación: Crea una transacción pendiente en BD

@baseUrl = https://servicioshilda.orioncaribe.com/api/v1
@walletAddress = 11111111111111111111111111111111
@tokenAmount = 100
@paymentMethod = SOL

###
# Iniciar compra con SOL (método recomendado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase/initiate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "walletAddress": "{{walletAddress}}",
  "tokenAmount": {{tokenAmount}},
  "paymentMethod": "{{paymentMethod}}"
}

###
# Iniciar compra con USDC
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase/initiate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "walletAddress": "{{walletAddress}}",
  "tokenAmount": 100,
  "paymentMethod": "USDC"
}

###
# Iniciar compra con Stripe (Fiat)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase/initiate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "walletAddress": "{{walletAddress}}",
  "tokenAmount": 50,
  "paymentMethod": "stripe",
  "email": "usuario@example.com"
}

###
# Iniciar compra con Coingate (Crypto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase/initiate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "walletAddress": "{{walletAddress}}",
  "tokenAmount": 100,
  "paymentMethod": "coingate"
}

###
# Iniciar compra con slippage tolerance personalizado
POST {{baseUrl}}/purchase/initiate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "walletAddress": "{{walletAddress}}",
  "tokenAmount": 100,
  "paymentMethod": "SOL",
  "slippageTolerance": 0.5
}

